roles: colleague, boss, elder
earth: the first days in parliament: the oath, a pass, a locker, a desk shared with three others and nowhere to sit in the chamber
tribal: the first days at the great gathering of the clans as your band's speaker, among hundreds of strangers and their fires
magic: the first sitting of the Assembly of the realm: the oath under the Order's seal, a pass warded to your hand and a bench at the back
requires: in the threshold season of member of parliament, within the first six months after taking the title (opened by 'election night', a by-election or any other way in): step 1, the first weeks in the house
