- U | design it on the evidence, pilot it, and let the results decide | identity | v: universalism, achievement | grants: drafting policy | tribal: try it first in one camp, watch what happens, and let that decide | chance: 70
- B | make it your own, cut the deals in cabinet, and put your name on it | identity | v: power, achievement | grants: a reform with your name on it | tribal: make it your own, strike the bargains among the speakers, and put your name to it | magic: make it your own, strike the bargains at court, and set your seal on it | chance: 20
- R | announce the reform in a fiery speech, before the department is ready | identity | binds | v: stimulation, self-direction | mark: took a wild risk | tribal: announce the change at the great fire, before the old hands are ready | magic: proclaim the reform in the Assembly, before the clerks are ready | chance: 52
